---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stellar Blade — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="Stellar Blade buying guide: the 2024 action game, editions, and where to buy the digital PS5 version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Stellar Blade — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Stellar Blade</strong> is Shift Up's stylish post-apocalyptic action game,
      praised for its tight parry-based combat and striking art direction. A sleeper hit
      of 2024.
    </p>

    <h2>Editions and DLC</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full campaign</li>
      <li><strong>Complete Edition</strong> — bundles the <em>Nier</em> crossover DLC and extra costumes; better value for new buyers</li>
      <li><strong>Digital vs physical</strong> — digital keys on key stores often cheaper than the PS Store</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      A 2024 release, Stellar Blade's first real cuts appear a few months after launch.
      Green Man Gaming's PSN codes undercut the PlayStation Store when sales open.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=stellar+blade+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Stellar+Blade+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
